  "description": "Even if he lost his memories, the desire to keep him close draws him into his world. As they tread a precarious emotional line, they sink into a cradle tangled with lies. The tense psychological warfare begins between two men protecting Lian while harboring secrets that could be exposed at any moment. Must love be defined in a certain way to be called love? A story of men who cross boundaries, willing to give their all.\n\n[Official English](https://comics.inkr.com/title/4680-ink-on-you)",
